OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has defended his latest
OL,7,Fdevolution announcement, in which
OL,8,Fregional mayors will get a share of
OL,9,Fincome tax to reallocate funding
OL,10,Flocally, claiming the move is "freeing
OL,11,Fup places to go further and faster".
OL,13,FThe plans allow English mayors to keep
OL,14,Fa share of the income tax and business
OL,15,Frates collected in their area, with
OL,16,Fthe full details, including what
OL,17,Fproportion of taxes the local leaders
OL,18,Fwill keep, set to be released after
OL,19,Fthe budget in the autumn.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FBurnham said: "Under our plans, more
OL,7,Fof the taxes raised in a community
OL,8,Fwill stay in that community. Soon,
OL,9,Fevery local leader will have the power
OL,10,Fand resources to improve public
OL,11,Ftransport, build homes and create
OL,12,Fjobs."
OL,14,FSpeaking to ITV News, the prime
OL,15,Fminister insisted that this move is a
OL,16,F"fundamental shift of power from the
OL,17,Fnational level to the regional level".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FUnder the plans, the share of taxes
OL,7,Fwill only be given to areas which have
OL,8,Fregional mayors, such as Greater
OL,9,FManchester, and not to local
OL,10,Fauthorities, raising fears that this
OL,11,Fwill further inequality by allowing
OL,12,Fonly metro areas to grow with this
OL,13,Ffunding.
OL,15,FThe rate of income tax that billpayers
OL,16,Fface will not change as a direct
OL,17,Fresult of the reforms, according to
OL,18,Fthe government.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FMinisters will retain an equalisation
OL,7,Fsystem, so areas where less tax is
OL,8,Fcollected continue to receive
OL,9,Ffinancial support.
OL,11,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,12,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,13,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,14,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,16,FFirst Secretary of State, Louise Haigh
OL,17,Fdefended the move, explaining the
OL,18,Fgovernment has plans to set up
OL,19,F"strategic authorities" in the future
OL,20,Fwhich may then be eligible for this
OL,21,Ftype of funding.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FBurnham insisted this move was "not
OL,7,Fabout depriving anywhere" and said
OL,8,Fthat London and Manchester do not need
OL,9,Fthe same support from central
OL,10,Fgovernment, so funding can be
OL,11,Freallocated.
OL,13,FHe said this new sharing of income tax
OL,14,Fmeans: "there is more to be given to
OL,15,Fthe areas that need that initial
OL,16,Finvestment to get things moving.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,F"So this is not about depriving
OL,7,Fanywhere. It's freeing up places to go
OL,8,Ffurther and to go faster but at the
OL,9,Fsame time making sure there's support
OL,10,Ffor everywhere.
OL,12,F"And of course we are saying that all
OL,13,Fareas can benefit from devolved power.
OL,14,FAll areas can be given the ability to
OL,15,Fhave some of the powers that some of
OL,16,Fthe big city regions have already got."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FWhen questioned about the idea that
OL,7,Fthis is not an increase in money,
OL,8,FBurnham defended it and said that it
OL,9,Fis new money because the investment
OL,10,Fwill be more localised.
OL,12,FHe said: "It will mean new money
OL,13,Fbecause it's about giving mayors and
OL,14,Fdevolved authorities the ability to
OL,15,Fkeep more of the tax that comes when
OL,16,Fthey grow their local economy."
OL,18,FBurnham claimed the current model is
OL,19,Fnot effective for the local economy.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,F"So public funding that's already
OL,7,Fthere but isn't as effective as it
OL,8,Fshould be is coming into the control
OL,9,Fof local areas.
OL,11,F"Do not underestimate the significance
OL,12,Fof what is being announced today,"
OL,13,Fsaid the prime minister.
OL,15,FSome Conservative and Reform regional
OL,16,Fmayors like Tees Valley mayor Ben
OL,17,FHouchen have suggested they may spend
OL,18,Fthis funding by giving local people a
OL,19,Ftax rebate, but the government has
OL,20,Finsisted this is not what the funding
OL,21,Fis for.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
