FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FBurnham implied he was against this
OL,7,Fidea, saying the plan is about growth
OL,8,Fand investment.
OL,10,F"This is a growth agenda and an
OL,11,Finvestment agenda, not a cuts agenda
OL,12,Fbecause the cuts agenda has left us in
OL,13,Fa difficult position," he said.
OL,15,FHaigh also suggested that mayors can
OL,16,Fspend their money as they want but
OL,17,Fsaid that the money should be invested
OL,18,Finto public services to benefit the
OL,19,Fwhole community instead.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
