PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785568686
OL,3,CBurnham denies devolution plans will
OL,4,Cworsen regional inequality
OL,6,FThe funding model is in line with
OL,7,Fother G7 countries, where devolution
OL,8,Fis much more common, and mayors have
OL,9,Fgreater powers with less centralised
OL,10,Fgovernmental decisions.
OL,12,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,13,Four political experts are across all
OL,14,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,15,Fto the latest episode below...
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
